---
const siteKey = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY ?? "";
const enabled = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_FANOUT_ENABLED === "true" && Boolean(siteKey);
---
<section data-fanout-planner data-site-key={siteKey} data-enabled={String(enabled)}>
  <form data-planner-form>
    <label for="fanout-question">What do you want to explore?</label>
    <textarea id="fanout-question" name="question" rows="2" maxlength="120" placeholder="How can I check whether my content appears in AI answers?" required></textarea>
    <output data-question-count>0 / 120</output>
    <div data-turnstile-slot aria-label="Human verification"></div>
    <button type="submit" disabled={!enabled}>Show follow-up questions</button>
    {!enabled && <p role="status">The free tool is not open yet. We are finishing the safeguards that keep it private, reliable, and within a fixed cost limit. The guides below are already available.</p>}
    <p data-form-status aria-live="polite"></p>
  </form>
  <section data-plan-output hidden aria-live="polite"><h2 data-plan-summary></h2><dl><div><dt>Model</dt><dd data-plan-model></dd></div><div><dt>Planner</dt><dd data-plan-version></dd></div><div><dt>Generated</dt><dd data-plan-date></dd></div></dl><ol data-plan-branches></ol><p data-plan-notice></p><aside><h3>Branches are not a content strategy yet.</h3><p>Use SEO Fanout to decide which branch deserves a page, a section, consolidation or no action. Use Contextter for the broader evidence-led workflow.</p><small>Ownership disclosure: ai-fanout.com, SEO Fanout and Contextter are operated by Matthias Ramahi. These links are not independent recommendations.</small><nav><a href="https://seo-fanout.com" rel="external">Evaluate in SEO Fanout</a><a href="https://contextter.com" rel="external">Continue in Contextter</a></nav></aside></section>
</section>
<script src="../scripts/fanout-planner.ts"></script>
